# Byte-identical checkouts regardless of a contributor's core.autocrlf setting.
# This repository is archived and cited, so what a reader clones has to match
# what was committed — otherwise checksums over the working tree disagree with
# the published artefact. (mitelman_fusions.tsv arrives with CRLF from its
# upstream source; it is stored and checked out as LF.)
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary payloads: never normalised, never diffed as text.
*.pt  binary
*.bam binary
*.bai binary
*.gz  binary
